头挖掘。\n\t\n也许跟着它才是在这一带四处走动的唯一办法……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"18b4b06059e05d0e6ab1fc1d6df3134e01895a734323bc74056702ad676a7d30","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"de9af808fffcbe480b1c10f7948a421f6f7571f4015e5fa16557cc1cdc42fa85","logical_entry_identity":"444ce4d889e4477ac44ad46515662d7043307b04d9e2a2ae97fa037bd05b7536","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your body's internal organs are indistinct, disguising your vital areas.\n\t\tYou have a %d%% chance to shrug off all direct critical hits (physical, mental, spell).\n\t\tIn addition you gain %d%% resistance to disease, poison, wounds and blindness.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你身体里的内脏全都融化在一起，隐藏了你的要害部位。\n\t\t你有 %d%% 几率摆脱任何（物理，精神，法术）暴击。\n\t\t你将额外获得 %d%% 的疾病、毒素、切割和目盲免疫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0019c5b01d9732c44d31e8acb52c8b3cbaa37e49dea0eb88295d3529cbb89297","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"de9e4d07d209936c024f1f277e4f0cac3399a459cd30f6752dca036c77fc8e77","logical_entry_identity":"e90b9a7e6532277d1d549684fbfe77ce02a59b2a6c3c622494cd50c4868a35b7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Scorched Boots","source_tag":"entity name","target":"烧焦的长靴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"95286fa04add342049c3454531a18618a03c2f0fef9acebb78d76254d46b585d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"de9e666ad0b4d9f1774c91cd59a443c4bf424afe3f58e12961bad77bbdcb6336","logical_entry_identity":"82269009c1dedc6b68ad67a42c674828801eed595a29a37e451fa26f31f65234","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This wooden cup seems perpetually filled with a thick sap-like substance. Tasting it is exhilarating, and you feel intensely aware when you do so.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个酒杯里装满了粘稠的物质，尝一口能提神醒脑。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"689f39c151678139fb083f9dc026373927a0ffef579bfdc7931bb34f50866f46","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"de9ebbf227f43c77042ae87c651de62e2d0361a3139eb96df7c0f4c2053effc1","logical_entry_identity":"391f57a1dc612d435370b440353390f21967d6033